---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---

<section id="about" class="section-shell scroll-mt-24 py-16 md:py-20">
  <div class="grid gap-8 border-t border-line pt-10 md:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr]">
    <h2 class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">About</h2>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
      <p>
        I am a computer engineering student working across the full stack of a
        system, from the transistor-level logic that makes a circuit behave, to
        the firmware and software that give it a purpose. I like problems where
        those layers have to agree on a single contract.
      </p>
      <p>
        Right now I am deepening my footing in digital design and embedded
        systems, and learning to measure what I build rather than assume it
        works. Based in {site.location}, open to internships and student
        collaborations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
